e.\n\n## Risks / Notes\n\n- Requires AMD Instinct hardware for end-to-end admission validation;\n  scheduling must be coordinated with the validation campaign's hardware\n  access (coordination risk, not a dependency).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":56803,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-95ba045d32a00c6b","agent_id":"aed3d9bc59117f76c","session_id":"ca1a66b0-be22-44b3-9715-c3e9690708e5","uuid":"e4d14608-a7d3-42f7-ae40-5dcc8192c33f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:44:05.000Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020"}
