released on completion.\n49\t\n50\t## Acceptance Criteria\n51\t\n52\t- A ROCm PyTorchJob requesting amd.com/gpu is admitted through a Kueue queue\n53\t  whose quota is configured for amd.com/gpu.\n54\t- Multi-worker (gang) admission holds for multi-GPU ROCm jobs: a workload is\n55\t  admitted only when all its pods' amd.com/gpu requests can be satisfied.\n56\t- Quota is correctly accounted while jobs run and released on completion.\n57\t\n58\t## HLR Traceability\n59\t\n60\t- HLR-3 (P1): PyTorch training on ROCm is supported for single- and multi-GPU\n61\t  jobs admitted through Kueue, with amd.com/gpu quota handling — this epic\n62\t  covers the admission and quota side.\n63\t\n64\t## Risks / Notes\n65\t\n66\t- Requires AMD Instinct hardware for end-to-end admission validation;\n67\t  scheduling must be coordinated with the validation campaign's hardware\n68\t  access (coordination risk, not a dependency).\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-89db8f0f5a287418","agent_id":"ab1e96f21a74eab04","session_id":"ca1a66b0-be22-44b3-9715-c3e9690708e5","uuid":"a634e405-132f-4196-ada6-5625833371e6","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:47:10.936Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3e026c6cf2117d4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9020 decomposition"}
